<title>NORWAY: Statoil in Rotterdam storage deal with Van Ommeren.</title>
<headline>Statoil in Rotterdam storage deal with Van Ommeren.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian state oil company Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Thursday it had concluded a storage and lighterage deal for methanol with Van Ommeren in the Dutch port of Rotterdam.</p>
<p>The deal will allow Statoil to supply methanol to customers in the Netherlands, Belgium and Germany from its new plant at Tjeldbergodden on the west coast of Norway.</p>
<p>The plant is due to begin production on April 1, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
